<section class="faq-section">
    <div class="faq-container">
        
        <!-- FAQ Header -->
        <div class="faq-header">
            <span class="faq-subtitle">FAQ</span>
            <h2 class="faq-title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Box containing all questions -->
        <div class="faq-box">
            
            <!-- Question 1 (Open by default) -->
            <div class="faq-item active">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    How do I book a taxi or tour?
                    <svg class="icon-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Use the form on this page, WhatsApp us, or call +91 96321 90350. Tell us your dates, pickup point, and vehicle preference — we confirm quickly.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Question 2 -->
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    Do you serve Mopa and Dabolim airports?
                    <svg class="icon-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes. We provide pickups and drops for both Goa airports as well as railway stations — share your flight or train details for smooth coordination.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Question 3 -->
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    Can we change the tour route on the day?
                    <svg class="icon-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Absolutely. Our North and South Goa plans are suggested itineraries. You can adjust stops with your driver within the time you have booked.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Question 4 -->
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    What vehicles do you offer?
                    <svg class="icon-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Sedan, Toyota Innova Crysta (7+1), Tempo Traveller (24+1), and more — see Our Fleet for photos and details.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Question 5 -->
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-question">
                    Is Goa safe for solo and family travellers?
                    <svg class="icon-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>We assign professional drivers and focus on safe, comfortable rides. Many families and solo travellers book with us — read reviews for real experiences.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>



